file tools/caravan_refusals_witness.rish the proof -- self-test, run-time parity against seL4's own header, both RED paths, the licence re-read per file
file tools/fixtures/caravan_refusal_symbol_scan.sh the vocabulary diff, in a fixture so the shell owns its quoting (REDS %85's loom)
file tools/fixtures/caravan_refusal_collapse_control.sh the collapsed-mapping control, planted in a copy and swept after
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish the new rung registered, so the choir's bijection stays whole at 100
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish module pin 102 -> 103 and the body count moved with the measurement
file tools/caravan_ladder_spine_witness.rish module pin moved in the same commit as the code it measures
file tools/caravan_ladder_print_witness.rish module pin moved in the same commit as the code it measures
file caravan/README.md the durable record -- the three distinct answers, the seven debts, and what this rung does not claim
file external-research/20260821-043831_the-libsel4-reach-and-the-vocabulary-caravan-inherits.md next-rung one marked landed, in the same commit as the code that landed it
file crux/REMEMBER.md Now refilled with live work; the reached-ground chronicle folded to a prior-edge pointer
recommend keep-going The derivation tree is the next rung and it is ungated: grants that may be handed on form a tree, which is what makes delete-first and revoke-first answerable, and it is the largest of the seven debts this round named. The one gate worth Keaton's eye stays small -- jinja2 and ply on the pier's Python environment open five more libsel4 headers in a single step.
